John: Unless if the trapdoor keys make it harder for you to maneuver, but it would not make sense as they’re attached to the access panels. :-|
N: Ok John we’re done, I’m leaving. :-| (when N completes the level) Just too easy John. :-D
John: Just you wait N, your pal Kevin won’t be safe either. /:-(
N: What’s that supposed to mean. /:-(
